myelin 1
id      tailwind
about   Tailwind CSS v4.3 (CSS-first config, @import "tailwindcss", @tailwindcss/postcss): bans v3 directives, removed utilities and config patterns
fires   tailwind | tailwindcss | tailwind css | @tailwindcss/postcss | @tailwindcss/vite | tailwind.config | utility classes
status  Researched 2026-10-26 against Tailwind CSS 4.3.3 docs and the v3->v4 upgrade guide. Regex-level checks. Snippets not executed.

= version     4.3.3 (npm latest; v3-lts tag is 3.4.19)
= verified    2026-10-26
= entry       one CSS file with @import "tailwindcss"; theme tokens live in @theme as CSS variables
= build       PostCSS plugin is @tailwindcss/postcss, Vite plugin is @tailwindcss/vite, CLI is @tailwindcss/cli; no autoprefixer or postcss-import needed
= content     template files are detected automatically; add extra paths with @source, safelist with @source inline()
= browsers    Safari 16.4+, Chrome 111+, Firefox 128+

! T1 /@tailwind\s+(?:base|components|utilities|variants|screens)\b/   The @tailwind directives were removed in v4. Use a single @import "tailwindcss"; -> $css
! T2 /\b(?:bg|text|border|divide|ring|placeholder)-opacity-(?:\d|\[|\()/   *-opacity-* utilities were removed in v4. Use an opacity modifier on the color: bg-black/50, text-white/75, border-gray-900/10. -> $card
! T3 /\bflex-(?:grow|shrink)(?:-[\w.[\]]+)?(?![\w-]|\s*:)/   flex-grow-* and flex-shrink-* were removed from v4 docs. Use grow, grow-0, shrink, shrink-0. -> $card
! T4 /\boverflow-ellipsis\b/   overflow-ellipsis was removed in v4. Use text-ellipsis (or truncate). -> $card
! T5 /(?<![\w-])decoration-(?:slice|clone)\b/   decoration-slice/decoration-clone were removed in v4. Use box-decoration-slice / box-decoration-clone.
! T6 /\btailwindcss['"]?\s*:\s*\{|require\(\s*['"]tailwindcss['"]\s*\)/   In v4 the PostCSS plugin is the separate package @tailwindcss/postcss; drop autoprefixer and postcss-import. -> $postcss
! T7 /\bnpx\s+tailwindcss\s/   In v4 the CLI is the separate package @tailwindcss/cli (npx @tailwindcss/cli -i in.css -o out.css); there is no init command. -> $css
! T8 /\b(?:corePlugins|safelist)\s*:/   corePlugins and safelist are not supported in v4. Safelist with @source inline("..."); there is no way to disable core plugins. -> $css
! T9 /tailwindcss\/resolveConfig/   resolveConfig was removed in v4. Read theme values as CSS variables (var(--color-blue-500), or getComputedStyle in JS).
! T10 /[a-z0-9]-\[--[\w-]+\]/   v4 changed the CSS-variable shorthand from square brackets to parentheses: bg-(--brand-color), not bg-[--brand-color]. -> $card

~ P1 Size-shift renames in v4 (the old names still exist but render one step smaller/different): shadow-sm -> shadow-xs, shadow -> shadow-sm, drop-shadow-sm -> drop-shadow-xs, drop-shadow -> drop-shadow-sm, blur-sm -> blur-xs, blur -> blur-sm, backdrop-blur-sm -> backdrop-blur-xs, backdrop-blur -> backdrop-blur-sm, rounded-sm -> rounded-xs, rounded -> rounded-sm. Write the v4 name for the v3 look.
~ P2 outline-none now really sets outline-style: none. To hide the focus outline but keep it in forced-colors mode use outline-hidden (the old v3 behaviour).
~ P3 Bare ring is now 1px and currentColor (was 3px blue-500). Write ring-3 plus an explicit ring color, e.g. focus:ring-3 focus:ring-blue-500.
~ P4 border-* and divide-* default to currentColor (was gray-200). Always add a color: border border-gray-200.
~ P5 Configure in CSS, not tailwind.config.js: tokens in @theme (--color-*, --font-*, --breakpoint-*), dark mode with @custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *)), custom classes with @utility instead of @layer utilities/components, plugins with @plugin. A JS config is no longer auto-detected; load it explicitly with @config only for legacy setups.
~ P6 Prefer bg-linear-to-r (and bg-radial, bg-conic, bg-linear-45) over the legacy bg-gradient-to-r name.
~ P7 Put the important modifier at the end (flex! bg-red-500!); the leading !flex form is deprecated. A prefix is written like a variant: tw:flex, set with @import "tailwindcss" prefix(tw).
~ P8 Variants stack left to right in v4 (*:first:pt-0, not first:*:pt-0). hover only applies on devices that support hover.
~ P9 Use CSS variables instead of theme(): var(--color-red-500); where theme() is unavoidable use the variable name, theme(--breakpoint-xl), not theme(screens.xl).
~ P10 In CSS modules or Vue/Svelte/Astro <style> blocks, add @reference "../app.css" (or @reference "tailwindcss") before using @apply. -> $reference
~ P11 Container queries (@container, @sm:, @max-md:) are in core; do not add @tailwindcss/container-queries. transform-none no longer resets rotate-*/scale-*/translate-*; reset the individual property instead (e.g. focus:scale-none).
~ P12 Since 4.1.15/4.2: break-words -> wrap-break-word, start-* / end-* -> inset-s-* / inset-e-* (old names deprecated, still work).
~ P13 With Vite, use the @tailwindcss/vite plugin instead of PostCSS. -> $vite

$ css
@import "tailwindcss";
@plugin "@tailwindcss/typography";
@source "../node_modules/@acme/ui";
@source inline("underline");

@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));

@theme {
  --font-display: "Satoshi", "sans-serif";
  --breakpoint-3xl: 120rem;
  --color-brand-500: oklch(0.62 0.19 259.8);
  --color-brand-600: oklch(0.55 0.2 262.9);
}

@utility content-auto {
  content-visibility: auto;
}

@layer base {
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }
}
$$

$ postcss
export default {
  plugins: {
    "@tailwindcss/postcss": {},
  },
};
$$

$ vite
import { defineConfig } from "vite";
import tailwindcss from "@tailwindcss/vite";

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [tailwindcss()],
});
$$

$ card
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-xs dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-gray-900">
  <img class="size-12 shrink-0 rounded-full" src="/avatar.jpg" alt="" />
  <div class="min-w-0 grow">
    <p class="truncate font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Ada Lovelace</p>
    <p class="overflow-hidden text-sm text-ellipsis whitespace-nowrap text-gray-500">ada@example.com</p>
  </div>
  <button class="rounded-sm bg-(--color-brand-500) px-3 py-1.5 text-white hover:bg-brand-600 focus:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-brand-500/50">
    Follow
  </button>
</div>
<div class="fixed inset-0 bg-black/50"></div>
<div class="h-2 bg-linear-to-r from-brand-500 to-sky-400"></div>
$$

$ reference
@reference "../../app.css";

.title {
  @apply text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900;
}
$$
